<http://data.silknow.org/object/50469796-21fa-3c18-b8f2-54285b503d01/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Embroidered in polychrome wools in tent stitch on natural colored linen canvas. In the center, a shepherdess strolling in a rustic setting. In one hand she carries a staff and in the other a bouquet. In the foreground, a dog and a lamb (?), and in the background a small house. The picture is framed in a narrow beige border with oblique stripes in red. Surrounding this, a wide floral border. Very worn, large areas missing."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/50469796-21fa-3c18-b8f2-54285b503d01> .

